AIME_24_3_models_GLM
# Task C evidence bundle: the artifacts every number in README_HARNESS.md §8 cites.
# `**/outputs` above excludes run output wholesale; these lines re-include only the small
# auditable products -- summary metrics, the exported harness with its full edit log, and the
# selection logs (~600KB). The trajectory corpus (~43MB) and wandb dirs stay out; the six
# trajectories that docs/findings/transfer-cases.md analyses line by line are force-added.
!outputs/
outputs/*
!outputs/harness/
outputs/harness/*/trajectories/
outputs/harness/*/wandb/
# Local wandb bookkeeping, not evidence: the run id, the record of whether this machine has
# already pushed the derived metrics to that run, and the dry-run preview. All three describe
# this checkout's relationship to a wandb account rather than anything about the experiment --
# the numbers themselves are in metrics.jsonl and the selection logs, which are committed.
outputs/harness/*/wandb_run_id.txt
outputs/harness/*/wandb_backfill.json
outputs/harness/*/wandb_backfill_preview.json
